# topmind-writing-skills · version control ignore rules

# Principle: regenerateable artifacts, machine-local state, and secrets never enter the repo.

# ── Dependencies ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
# 根安装器和各技能目前都没有 npm 依赖，锁文件只会是空壳，不提交、不进 npm 包。
# 以后某个技能加了运行时依赖：在下面加一行 !<技能>/package-lock.json 并提交它的锁文件，
# 门禁会改用 npm ci --omit=dev（npm 包仍由 package.json "files" 排除锁文件）。
package-lock.json
**/package-lock.json

# ── Build / regression artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
**/dist/
report-assets/
**/report-assets/
render-compare/
**/render-compare/

# ── Python cache / venv ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# ── IDE / agent local state (never publish) ─────────────────────────────
.codebuddy/
.h3caiwork/
.playwright-mcp/
.claude/
.agents/
.mimocode/
.idea/
.vscode/

# ── Temp / logs / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
scripts/_*
**/scripts/_*
*.tmp
*.log
*.bak
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Internal planning notes (not for release) ───────────────────────────
OPTIMIZATION-PLAN.md
**/OPTIMIZATION-PLAN.md

# ── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json

# Machine-local privacy denylist (usernames/hostnames). Never commit.
scripts/.privacy-deny.local
**/.privacy-deny.local

# Release 附件与 npm pack 输出
release-assets/
*.tgz
